  "subject": {
    "id": "optional-grounded-knowledge-packs",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Bind the optional pack vocabulary and structural grounding checker.",
  "why": "Three optional packs now expose small reusable vocabularies without becoming protocol requirements. Exact term groups retain honest source attribution, locally invented names are explicit, and the offline rite checks only the closed citation shape. This advances the LinkML support profile without adding a mapping language, domain-history choice, Event population, or network-dependent judgment."
